=== Text #1 ===
> ["]Fast and friendly[ pharmacy]! They always welcome me by name along with a smile."
[Here] at Hillcrest Dispensary, we believe that being a community pharmacy means your experience should be personalized and unique. We have been proudly serving the Hinton communities for years and our friendly staff is dedicated to providing you with a service that is unmatched by others. Our expert pharmacists will take the time[ to] answer all of your questions and our friendly, professional staff will make you feel right at home. Being a customer-centered pharmacy means your happiness and well-being is our top priority. Stop by today and and experience the difference a community pharmacy[ can] make.[]

